          <h3>How I Met Your Mother</h3>

          <div class="rating">
            ★★★★★
          </div>

          <p>
            Comfort, comedy, friendships
            and a little bit of chaos.
          </p>
        </div>

      </article>


      <article class="show-card">

        <div class="show-image">
          <img src="images/image4.jpg" alt="Currently watching">
        </div>

        <div class="show-info">
          <span>SERIES</span>
          <h3>The Nanny</h3>

          <div class="rating">
            ★★★★★
          </div>

