      <p>
        A little romance, a little comedy,
        unforgettable characters and exactly
        the kind of movie that deserves
        a rewatch.
      </p>

      <div class="movie-note">
        <span>MOOD</span>
        <strong>ROM-COM · 90s/2000s · COMFORT</strong>
      </div>

    </div>

  </section>


  <!-- COMFORT SHOWS -->

  <section class="comfort">

    <p class="eyebrow">04 — COMFORT SHOWS</p>

    <h2>
      Shows I could<br>
      watch <i>forever.</i>
    </h2>


    <div class="comfort-list">

      <div>
        <span>01</span>
        <strong>CRIMINAL MINDS</strong>
        <p>For the mystery & the familiar faces.</p>
